    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Dread Talons",
    "summary": "**Aura (12\")**: during [your opponent's Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), in its [Battle-shock step](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock-step), each enemy unit below its [Starting Strength](vsdata:core-rule/units-and-models) that is in range of any of your **HERETIC ASTARTES** units has to make a [Battle-shock test](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock).\n\n**Aura (12\")**: whenever an enemy unit in range of any of your **HERETIC ASTARTES** units makes a Battle-shock test, it gets -1 to the result.\n\nAn enemy unit this Detachment rule affects need not make another Battle-shock test that phase.",
